# JWT signing key material — never commit private/public keys.
# In-cluster, keys come from a Kubernetes Secret (see k8s/users-deployment.yaml
# and README.md "JWT keys" section). For local (non-container) dev, generate
# your own pair into services/users/keys/.
services/users/keys/
*.key
*.pem
